{"id":"pattern-example-001","type":"pattern","fact":"Example: Use mock factories for all test data instead of manual mock objects with 'as Type' assertions.","recommendation":"Create centralized mock factory functions (createMockUser, createMockOrg, etc.) and import them in tests.","confidence":"high","provenance":[{"source":"documentation","reference":"Testing guide","date":"2026-01-09"}],"tags":["testing","mocks","factories"],"affectedFiles":["**/*.test.ts"],"affectedServices":[],"createdAt":"2026-01-09T00:00:00Z","updatedAt":"2026-01-09T00:00:00Z","usageCount":0,"helpfulCount":0,"outdatedReports":0}
{"id":"pattern-001","type":"pattern","fact":"After a worktree agent completes, follow this cycle: (1) copy new files to main worktree, (2) re-fix shared files — router.py (add new sub-router import + include_router), conftest.py (env vars), vitest.config.ts (coverage includes), (3) run full backend + frontend validation, (4) commit only after validation passes.","recommendation":"Never commit agent output without re-merging shared files and re-validating. Treat router.py, conftest.py, and vitest.config.ts as merge-conflict-prone files that always need manual reconciliation.","confidence":"high","provenance":[{"source":"agent","reference":"Orchestrated execution WU-1 through WU-16","date":"2026-02-28"}],"tags":["orchestration","worktree","merge","validation","workflow"],"affectedFiles":["backend/app/api/router.py","backend/tests/conftest.py","frontend/vitest.config.ts"],"affectedServices":[],"createdAt":"2026-02-28T00:00:00Z","updatedAt":"2026-02-28T00:00:00Z","usageCount":0,"helpfulCount":0,"outdatedReports":0}
{"id":"pattern-002","type":"pattern","fact":"All API routers use create_*_router() factory functions for dependency injection. Some factories require keyword args from settings (create_groups_router needs encryption_key, google_client_id, google_client_secret). The router aggregation in router.py must import settings and pass these args.","recommendation":"When adding a new router to router.py, check the factory function signature for required kwargs. Import settings from app.config and pass the appropriate settings values.","confidence":"high","provenance":[{"source":"agent","reference":"WU-11 groups router integration","date":"2026-02-28"}],"tags":["fastapi","router","dependency-injection","factory-pattern"],"affectedFiles":["backend/app/api/router.py","backend/app/api/*.py"],"affectedServices":[],"createdAt":"2026-02-28T00:00:00Z","updatedAt":"2026-02-28T00:00:00Z","usageCount":0,"helpfulCount":0,"outdatedReports":0}
